// Windows LAPS Credential Dump From Entra ID | T1098.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/azure/audit_logs/azure_auditlogs_laps_credential_dumping.yml
any where category:"Device" and activityType:"*Recover device local administrator password*" and additionalDetails.additionalInfo:"*Successfully recovered local credential by device id*"
